	It defaults to namespace 0, so the prefixed search would never have
	matched a Project- or Talk-namespace page, however well the prefix
	fit.
	(mediawiki-discussion-tools--known-ids)
	(mediawiki-discussion-tools--vanished)
	(mediawiki-discussion-tools--vanished-ids)
	(mediawiki-discussion-tools--report-refresh): Remember the thread
	IDs from the last refresh and report how many disappeared, since
