2026-05-14  Mark A. Hershberger  <mah@everybody.org>

	* mediawiki.el: Bump version to 3.0.1.

	* mediawiki-api.el (mediawiki-page-get-revision): Fix content
        key extraction from JSON.  MediaWiki API uses "*" as the key
        for page content in slots, not "content".  Changed from
        (alist-get 'content ...) to (alist-get '* ...).

        * mediawiki-auth.el (mediawiki-do-login): Include reason in
        error message for unexpected login results (e.g., "Aborted").
        Previously only showed the result code without the helpful
        explanation.

        * tests/test-mediawiki-api.el: Add regression tests for empty
        JSON parsing (test-mediawiki-json-parse-empty).  Update
        test fixtures to use "*" key for slot content.

        * tests/test-mediawiki-api-json.el: Rename from
        test-mediawiki-api-xml.el to reflect JSON-based testing.

        * mediawiki-api.el (mediawiki-api-call): Handle empty JSON
        response ({}) from action=logout.  json-parse-string returns nil
        for an empty object, which the previous nil-check wrongly treated
        as a parse failure.  Use condition-case instead so genuine parse
        errors are caught while valid empty responses pass through.

